,"feedback":"He told me that the shop was closed. He said to me that the shop was closed would also be grammatical, but uses say.","optionFeedback":[{"key":"a","text":"Tell takes the person directly in this frame."},{"key":"b","text":"The intended tell + person frame is missing its recipient."},{"key":"c","text":"To does not introduce the person after told in this frame."}],"fieldFeedback":[],"comparison":{"claim":"reporting_verb_complement","scenario":"Choose the sentence that uses tell correctly to report a statement.","requiredInference":"Practise the tell + person complement; optional extension, not an additional core learning outcome.","solution":"He told me that the shop was closed. He said to me that the shop was closed would also be grammatical, but uses say.","nearest":["ENG7-U01-P10"],"disposition":"intentional_practice_variant","rationale":"Practise the tell + person complement; optional extension, not an additional core learning outcome.","existingBankMatches":[],"guideRelationship":"Familiar taught/practice content; the corresponding lesson guide teaches this procedure. No unseen capacity claimed."},"source":null}},{"itemId":"93391aa2-194a-54cc-ad87-73d366ba43e2","itemCode":"ENG7-U01-P12","context":{"schemaVersion":"haiedu-authoring-review-v1","itemCode":"ENG7-U01-P12","version":1,"locale":"en","sourcePacket":"docs/content/english-7-unit-01-draft.json","sourceReference":"Grigoryan, English 7, Zangak 2023; pp. 12; activities 13; programme T1.K3; docs/content/english-7-unit-01-draft.json#ENG7-U01-P12","hint":"Ask whether the word describes a thing or how an action happens.","feedback":"Soft describes the fabric; quietly describes speaking. Position alone does not decide the word class.","optionFeedback":[],"fieldFeedback":[{"id":"f1","text":"Feels links the fabric to a quality, so an adjective is needed.","rejectedExamples":["softly"]},{"id":"f2","text":"The word describes how the designer spoke, so an adverb is needed.","rejectedExamples":["quiet"]}],"co