 type, not an identified pair or set of pairs. The general plural boots uses zero article.","rejectedExamples":["a","an","the"]}],"comparison":{"disposition":"protected_parallel_assessment_variant","protocol":"haiedu-protected-parallel-pilot-v1","authorization":"docs/evidence/english-7-unit-01-owner-acceptance-20261021.json","repeatedTaughtClaim":"Explicit zero article","nearestPractice":["ENG7-U01-P26","ENG7-U01-P25"],"nearestBatch":["ENG7-U01-DA-20","ENG7-U01-MA-18","ENG7-U01-MA-19"],"newStimulusInterpretation":"Infer category-wide reference from a corrective exchange instead of being told to fill one generic and one specific mass-noun frame. This replaces the initial paired frames that mirrored DA-20 and Practice P26.","completeSolution":"The customer rejects the footwear type as a whole. Zero preserves that general plural reference; the would point to an identified set, and a/an cannot precede plural boots.","guideRelationship":"G09 teaches the shared procedure; its worked example does not provide this complete stimulus-specific answer.","protectionJudgment":"Retain as an author-proposed protected parallel variant: the stated new stimulus must be interpreted. Keep complete prompts, keys, scripts and source families out of Practice/Chapter Review. This is not independent new reasoning, empirical equivalence or specialist qualification.","independentNewReasoningClaimed":false,"semanticReviewer":"Codex automated author; independent human review pending"},"source":null}},{"itemId":"ee7fd3b7-3c62-508f-afd9-0b8030655fa6","itemCode":"ENG7-U01-MA-21","context":{"schemaVersion":"haiedu-authoring-review-v1","itemCode":"ENG7-U01-MA-21","version":1,"locale":"en","sourcePacket":"docs/content/english-7-unit-01-assessment-batch-a.json","sourceReference":"Grigoryan, English 7, Zangak 2023; pp. 17, 18; activities 19; programme T1.L2; docs/content/english-7-unit-01-assessment-batch-a.json#ENG7-U01-MA-21","hint":"Use the supplied information and preserve its meaning.","feedback":"