nd brand, f by faina, in 2016.\n\nThe profile describes clothes that combine simple, elegant shapes with noticeable details. It presents these choices as ways for different wearers to express their own character.\n\nThese are facts and descriptions reported by the profile, not a recommendation to prefer or buy the clothes.","sourceReferences":[],"reviewStatus":"pending","registrationStatus":"unregistered","audioAvailable":false}}},{"itemId":"bf9b27c1-9ea0-5855-ac04-fd62e826086f","itemCode":"ENG7-U01-MA-25","context":{"schemaVersion":"haiedu-authoring-review-v1","itemCode":"ENG7-U01-MA-25","version":1,"locale":"en","sourcePacket":"docs/content/english-7-unit-01-assessment-batch-a.json","sourceReference":"Grigoryan, English 7, Zangak 2023; pp. 6, 144; activities 8; programme T1.L1; docs/content/english-7-unit-01-assessment-batch-a.json#ENG7-U01-MA-25","hint":"Use the supplied information and preserve its meaning.","feedback":"The first label causes confusion; the replacement states its display-only purpose.","optionFeedback":[{"key":"a","text":"No sale takes place or is announced."},{"key":"b","text":"The speaker does not want to exchange the coat."},{"key":"c","text":"The first label causes confusion; the replacement states its display-only purpose."}],"fieldFeedback":[],"comparison":{"disposition":"protected_parallel_assessment_variant","protocol":"haiedu-protected-parallel-pilot-v1","authorization":"docs/evidence/english-7-unit-01-owner-acceptance-20261021.json","repeatedTaughtClaim":"Main message of AUDIO-A","nearestPractice":["ENG7-U01-L01","ENG7-U01-L03","ENG7-U01-L05","ENG7-U01-L07"],"nearestBatch":["ENG7-U01-DA-25","ENG7-U01-MA-26"],"newStimulusInterpretation":"Infer the message''s communication problem and solution, not a general clothing preference or DA''s repair solution.","completeSolution":"The first label causes confusion; the replacement states its display-only purpose.","guideRelationship":"G07 teaches the shared procedure; its worked example does not